{"type":"text","timestamp":1768791434644,"sessionID":"ses_42bd0b22affezSWq9SZp6F7aKL","part":{"id":"prt_bd42f6593001lEnE6ob8QR5i3n","sessionID":"ses_42bd0b22affezSWq9SZp6F7aKL","messageID":"msg_bd42f4e07001FfTACrPuJkRL1n","type":"text","text":"I'll help you implement host disconnect detection for the ChronoTunes game. Let me start by exploring the codebase to understand the existing structure.","time":{"start":1768791434643,"end":1768791434643}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1768791490744,"sessionID":"ses_42bd0b22affezSWq9SZp6F7aKL","part":{"id":"prt_bd42f6593002W6nun78jTeyOdR","sessionID":"ses_42bd0b22affezSWq9SZp6F7aKL","messageID":"msg_bd42f4e07001FfTACrPuJkRL1n","type":"tool","callID":"call_function_4cle6qfk1jxd_1","tool":"task","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Explore Convex structure","prompt":"Explore the ChronoTunes codebase to understand:\n1. The Convex schema (convex/schema.ts) - understand how lobbies, games, and players are structured\n2. Existing Convex functions in convex/ directory - particularly lobbies.ts, games.ts, players.ts\n3. How scheduled functions work in Convex (check if any exist)\n4. How sessionWrapper is used for authentication\n5. Any existing host-related logic\n\nReturn:\n- Full content of convex/schema.ts\n- List of files in convex/ directory\n- Key patterns for mutations, queries, and scheduled functions\n- Any existing hostId or host-related fields\n- How players connect/disconnect is currently handled","subagent_type":"explore"},"output":"## ChronoTunes Convex Architecture Report\n\n### 1. Full Content of `convex/schema.ts`\n\nThe schema defines 6 tables with the following structure:\n\n**Lobbies Table** (`lobbies`)\n- `code`: 6-character unique join code (indexed)\n- `hostSessionId`: session ID of the lobby creator\n- `hostTransferDeadline`: optional timestamp for host transfer\n- `status`: enum (`lobby`, `in_game`, `finished`)\n- `settings`: nested object with game configuration\n- `activeGameId`: optional reference to active game\n\n**Players Table** (`players`)\n- `lobbyId`: reference to lobby (indexed)\n- `sessionId`: client's session identifier (indexed by lobby + session)\n- `displayName`: player's display name\n- `isHost`: boolean flag\n- `coins`: betting currency\n- `timeline`: array of timeline entries\n- `timelineSize`: count of entries\n- `createdAt`: timestamp\n\n**Games Table** (`games`)\n- `lobbyId`: reference to lobby (indexed)\n- `status`: enum (`active`, `paused`, `finished`)\n- `startedAt`: timestamp\n- `endedAt`: optional timestamp\n- `currentRoundNumber`: round counter\n- `currentRoundId`: optional reference to current round\n- `turnPlayerId`: optional reference to player whose turn it is\n- `turnOrder`: array of player IDs\n- `winnerPlayerId`: optional reference to winning player\n\n**Rounds Table** (`rounds`)\n- `gameId`: reference to game (indexed)\n- `roundNumber`: round number\n- `turnPlayerId`: reference to player whose turn it is\n- `trackId`: reference to track being guessed\n- `phase`: enum (`placing`, `betting`, `resolved`)\n- `startedAt`: timestamp\n- `placementPreview`: optional preview object\n- `placement`: optional placement object\n- `guess`: optional guess object\n- `resolution`: optional resolution object\n\n**RoundBets Table** (`roundBets`)\n- `roundId`: reference to round (indexed)\n- `playerId`: reference to player (indexed by round + player)\n- `proposedIndex`: position in timeline\n- `placedAt`: timestamp\n- `lockedIn`: boolean flag\n- `status`: enum (`pending`, `won`, `lost`)\n\n**Tracks Table** (`tracks`)\n- `mbid`: optional MusicBrainz ID\n- `title`: track title\n- `artist`: artist name\n- `year`: release year (indexed)\n- `durationMs`: optional duration in milliseconds\n- `externalIds`: nested object with Spotify, YouTube, Deezer IDs\n- `links`: nested object with track URLs\n- `createdAt`: timestamp\n- `source`: import source\n\n---\n\n### 2. Files in `convex/` Directory\n\n```\nconvex/\n  convex.config.ts          # App configuration (presence middleware)\n  schema.ts                 # Database schema\n  lobbies.ts                # Lobby mutations/queries (create, join, leave, get, updateSettings)\n  players.ts                # Player queries (list, getMe)\n  games.ts                  # Game mutations/queries (start, getCurrent, skipTurn, resolveAndNext)\n  rounds.ts                 # Round mutations/queries (getCurrent, setPlacementPreview, submitPlacement)\n  bets.ts                   # Bet mutations/queries (preview, lockIn, cancel, listForRound)\n  tracks.ts                 # Track queries/mutations (list, get, getForRound, getPublic, importTracks)\n  presence.ts               # Presence mutations/queries (heartbeat, disconnect, list, room/user queries)\n  \n  lib/\n    sessionWrapper.ts       # Session ID utilities for auth\n    gameLogic.ts            # Pure functions for timeline validation\n    trackSelection.ts       # Track selection algorithm\n    \n  *.test.ts                 # Test files for each module\n```\n\n---\n\n### 3. Key Patterns for Convex Functions\n\n**Mutation Pattern:**\n```typescript\nexport const mutationName = mutation({\n  args: {\n    arg1: v.type1(),\n    arg2: v.type2(),\n  },\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    // 1. Fetch entities\n    const entity = await ctx.db.get(id);\n    \n    // 2. Validate\n    if (!entity) {\n      throw new ConvexError(\"Not found\");\n    }\n    \n    // 3. Perform mutations\n    await ctx.db.patch(id, { field: newValue });\n    \n    return result;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n**Query Pattern:**\n```typescript\nexport const queryName = query({\n  args: { arg: v.type() },\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const result = await ctx.db.query(\"table\").filter(...).first();\n    return result;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n**Host Authorization Pattern:**\n```typescript\nif (lobby.hostSessionId !== sessionId) {\n  throw new ConvexError(\"Only the host can perform this action\");\n}\n```\n\n**Scheduled Functions:** None currently exist in the codebase. The `convex.config.ts` only configures the `@convex-dev/presence` middleware.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Host-Related Logic Summary\n\n**Host Identification:**\n- `hostSessionId` field in `lobbies` table stores the session ID of the lobby creator\n- `isHost` boolean field in `players` table marks which player is the host\n\n**Host Privileges:**\n| Function | File | Host Check |\n|----------|------|------------|\n| `updateSettings` | `lobbies.ts:209` | `lobby.hostSessionId !== sessionId` |\n| `start` (game) | `games.ts:18` | `lobby.hostSessionId !== sessionId` |\n| `skipTurn` | `games.ts:114` | `lobby.hostSessionId !== sessionId` |\n| `resolveAndNext` | `games.ts:191` | `lobby.hostSessionId !== sessionId` |\n| `getForRound` (track) | `tracks.ts:26` | Returns track info only for host |\n| `getCurrent` (round) | `rounds.ts:5` | Returns `isHost: true/false` in response |\n\n**Host Transfer on Leave** (`lobbies.ts:166-178`):\n```typescript\nif (player.isHost) {\n  const remainingPlayers = await ctx.db.query(\"players\")...\n  if (remainingPlayers.length === 0) {\n    await ctx.db.delete(lobby._id);  // Delete lobby if no players left\n  } else {\n    const newHost = remainingPlayers[0];\n    await ctx.db.patch(newHost._id, { isHost: true });\n    await ctx.db.patch(lobby._id, { hostSessionId: newHost.sessionId });\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 5. SessionWrapper for Authentication\n\nLocated in `convex/lib/sessionWrapper.ts`:\n\n```typescript\nimport type { SessionId } from \"convex-helpers/server/sessions\";\nimport { SessionIdArg, vSessionId } from \"convex-helpers/server/sessions\";\n\nexport { vSessionId, SessionIdArg };\n\nexport async function getSessionId(\n  _ctx: QueryCtx | MutationCtx,\n  args: { sessionId?: SessionId },\n): Promise<SessionId | null> {\n  if (args.sessionId && typeof args.sessionId === \"string\") {\n    return args.sessionId as SessionId;\n  }\n  return null;\n}\n\nexport async function requireSessionId(\n  ctx: QueryCtx | MutationCtx,\n  args: { sessionId: SessionId },\n): Promise<SessionId> {\n  const sessionId = await getSessionId(ctx, args);\n  if (!sessionId) {\n    throw new Error(\"Session ID is required but was not provided\");\n  }\n  return sessionId;\n}\n```\n\n**Key Points:**\n- Uses `convex-helpers` for session management\n- Session ID is passed as a string argument, not extracted from auth tokens\n- Client generates and stores session ID in `localStorage` (`lib/session.ts`)\n\n---\n\n### 6. Player Connection/Disconnect Handling\n\n**Connection/Heartbeat** (`convex/presence.ts`):\n```typescript\nexport const sendHeartbeat = mutation({\n  args: { roomId, userId, sessionId, interval: optional(15000) },\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await presenceComponent.heartbeat(ctx, roomId, userId, sessionId, interval);\n  },\n});\n```\n\n**Presence Queries:**\n- `getPresenceList`: list all presences for a room token\n- `getRoomPresence`: list presences in a room\n- `getPlayerPresence`: list presences for a specific player\n- `disconnectPresence`: remove presence when disconnecting\n\n**Presence Middleware** (`convex/convex.config.ts`):\n```typescript\nimport presence from \"@convex-dev/presence/convex.config.js\";\nconst app = defineApp();\napp.use(presence);\n```\n\n**Manual Leave** (`lobbies.ts:136`):\n- `leave` mutation handles player removal from lobby\n- If host leaves and players remain, host is transferred to first remaining player\n- If host leaves and no players remain, lobby is deleted\n- **Note:** No automatic disconnect handling when browser closes (relies on manual leave or presence timeout)\n\n---\n\n### Summary of Key Observations\n\n1. **No scheduled functions exist** - All game progression is manual (host-driven via `skipTurn` and `resolveAndNext`)\n\n2. **Host is critical to game flow** - Host must be present to:\n   - Start the game\n   - Skip turns\n   - Resolve rounds and advance to next\n\n3. **Session-based auth** - No user accounts; session ID is stored in localStorage\n\n4. **Presence is available** - `@convex-dev/presence` is configured but appears minimally used (no auto-leave on disconnect)\n\n5. **Host transfer is automatic** - When host leaves, first remaining player becomes new host\n\n<task_metadata>\nsession_id: ses_42bd09160ffesC1mSXeI5sP3n8\n</task_metadata>","title":"Explore Convex structure","metadata":{"summary":[{"id":"prt_bd42f7c45001WtQJ7iDhIWsLkd","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","title":"convex/schema.ts"}},{"id":"prt_bd42f7c76001GaBnU9xM5D342N","tool":"glob","state":{"status":"completed","title":""}},{"id":"prt_bd42f7eae001We6g7PUtt58qVA","tool":"grep","state":{"status":"completed","title":"scheduled|scheduler"}},{"id":"prt_bd42f80ad001P6fpKXtblVbZUu","tool":"grep","state":{"status":"completed","title":"hostId|host"}},{"id":"prt_bd42f921d001XDeNcC0mfT7zW8","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","title":"convex/lobbies.ts"}},{"id":"prt_bd42f93ad001mQFEynekEkAdi3","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","title":"convex/players.ts"}},{"id":"prt_bd42f9563001BXHyMR5QANxx2d","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","title":"convex/games.ts"}},{"id":"prt_bd42f98ad0011d72rWVQ7Y7Kko","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","title":"convex/lib/sessionWrapper.ts"}},{"id":"prt_bd42f9934001sMVEKZtMwZjDOp","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","title":"convex/presence.ts"}},{"id":"prt_bd42f9ab1001dZS00l67JwqmPM","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","title":"convex/convex.config.ts"}},{"id":"prt_bd42fa8980029P7AZrPg8umrvg","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","title":"convex/rounds.ts"}},{"id":"prt_bd42faa0c001VOwLMf6p05Hgt2","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","title":"convex/bets.ts"}},{"id":"prt_bd42fab7a001Uz1Ckm54N4f0gr","tool":"grep","state":{"status":"completed","title":"heartbeat|disconnect|leave|presence"}},{"id":"prt_bd42fbbdb002wkNLaTHSfbtQOc","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","title":"convex/tracks.ts"}},{"id":"prt_bd42fbd8b001OA5FQVgLXbFZYU","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","title":"convex/lib/gameLogic.ts"}}],"sessionId":"ses_42bd09160ffesC1mSXeI5sP3n8","truncated":false},"time":{"start":1768791436958,"end":1768791490743}}}}
